This repository contains material under several licences. Which one applies
depends on what the file is, as set out below. Files not listed under sections
3 or 4 fall under section 1 if they are code or documentation and section 2 if
they are data or results.


1. Code and documentation: MIT License
======================================

Applies to the notebooks and scripts (tag-seq/code/, render-all.sh,
check-reproduction.R, manuscript/check-placeholders.R, .github/), the project
configuration (_quarto.yml, renv.lock, .Rprofile, CHECKSUMS.sha256), the
landing page (index.qmd), and the documentation (README.md,
REPRODUCIBILITY-PLAN.md, SUBMISSION-CHECKLIST.md, NOTES.md and the READMEs in
each directory).

